      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Shell process",
      "items": [
        "BarWidget.qml: two Processes, each timed out",
        "SplitParser drops output over a byte budget",
        "Panel / Sections / Rows / Mark only draw",
        "SiteRow > Section > Panel > BarWidget, by signal"
